搜索和回溯/BFS搜索/最短路径/迷宫-II/题解2.0.0-迷宫-II.content:
题解2.0.0 - 迷宫 II（The Maze II, LeetCode 505）
概述：用 Dijkstra 在“停点图”上求最短距离，滚动过程中累计步数作为边权。
题解一：Dijkstra（推荐）
Java 实现：
import java.util.*;

class Solution {
    public int shortestDistance(int[][] maze, int[] start, int[] destination) {
        int m = maze.length, n = maze[0].length;
        int[][] dist = new int[m][n];
        for (int[] row : dist) Arrays.fill(row, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
        dist[start[0]][start[1]] = 0;
        PriorityQueue&lt;int[]&gt; pq = new PriorityQueue&lt;&gt;(Comparator.comparingInt(a -&gt; a[2]));
        pq.offer(new int[]{start[0], start[1], 0});
        int[][] d = {{1,0},{-1,0},{0,1},{0,-1}};
        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {
            int[] cur = pq.poll();
            int x = cur[0], y = cur[1], cd = cur[2];
            if (cd &gt; dist[x][y]) continue;
            for (int[] mv : d) {
                int nx = x, ny = y, steps = 0;
                while (nx + mv[0] &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; nx + mv[0] &lt; m &amp;&amp; ny + mv[1] &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; ny + mv[1] &lt; n &amp;&amp; maze[nx + mv[0]][ny + mv[1]] == 0) {
                    nx += mv[0]; ny += mv[1]; steps++;
                }
                if (cd + steps &lt; dist[nx][ny]) {
                    dist[nx][ny] = cd + steps;
                    pq.offer(new int[]{nx, ny, dist[nx][ny]});
                }
            }
        }
        int ans = dist[destination[0]][destination[1]];
        return ans == Integer.MAX_VALUE ? -1 : ans;
    }
}
复杂度：

O(m·n·log(m·n))，滚动开销与 PQ 操作；空间 O(m·n)。

思考小结：

变权边需用 Dijkstra；BFS 不适用于可变滚动步长的最短路。

标签：Dijkstra、最短路、滚动网格

搜索和回溯/BFS搜索/最短路径/迷宫-III/题解2.0.0-迷宫-III.content:
题解2.0.0 - 迷宫 III（The Maze III, LeetCode 499）
概述：在滚动过程中若到达洞则停下，使用 Dijkstra 维护当前点到各停点的最短距离与对应路径字符串。
题解一：Dijkstra + 字典序（推荐）
Java 实现：
import java.util.*;

class Solution {
    static class State {
        int x, y, dist; String path;
        State(int x, int y, int dist, String path) { this.x = x; this.y = y; this.dist = dist; this.path = path; }
    }

    public String findShortestWay(int[][] maze, int[] ball, int[] hole) {
        int m = maze.length, n = maze[0].length;
        int[][] best = new int[m][n];
        String[][] bestPath = new String[m][n];
        for (int i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) Arrays.fill(best[i], Integer.MAX_VALUE);
        PriorityQueue&lt;State&gt; pq = new PriorityQueue&lt;&gt;((a, b) -&gt; {
            if (a.dist != b.dist) return a.dist - b.dist;
            return a.path.compareTo(b.path);
        });
        best[ball[0]][ball[1]] = 0; bestPath[ball[0]][ball[1]] = &quot;&quot;;
        pq.offer(new State(ball[0], ball[1], 0, &quot;&quot;));
        int[][] d = {{1,0},{-1,0},{0,1},{0,-1}};
        char[] dirCh = {&#039;d&#039;,&#039;u&#039;,&#039;r&#039;,&#039;l&#039;};
        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {
            State cur = pq.poll();
            if (cur.dist &gt; best[cur.x][cur.y]) continue;
            if (cur.x == hole[0] &amp;&amp; cur.y == hole[1]) return cur.path;
            for (int k = 0; k &lt; 4; k++) {
                int[] mv = d[k]; char ch = dirCh[k];
                int nx = cur.x, ny = cur.y, steps = 0;
                while (nx + mv[0] &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; nx + mv[0] &lt; m &amp;&amp; ny + mv[1] &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; ny + mv[1] &lt; n &amp;&amp; maze[nx + mv[0]][ny + mv[1]] == 0) {
                    nx += mv[0]; ny += mv[1]; steps++;
                    if (nx == hole[0] &amp;&amp; ny == hole[1]) break;
                }
                int nd = cur.dist + steps; String np = cur.path + ch;
                if (nd &lt; best[nx][ny] || (nd == best[nx][ny] &amp;&amp; (bestPath[nx][ny] == null || np.compareTo(bestPath[nx][ny]) &lt; 0))) {
                    best[nx][ny] = nd; bestPath[nx][ny] = np;
                    pq.offer(new State(nx, ny, nd, np));
                }
            }
        }
        return &quot;impossible&quot;;
    }
}
复杂度：

O(m·n·log(m·n))，空间 O(m·n)。

思考小结：

注意滚动时洞的提前停下；路径字符串作为次序关键字。

标签：Dijkstra、字典序、滚动网格

搜索和回溯/BFS搜索/状态图/单词接龙-II/题解2.0.0-单词接龙-II.content:
题解2.0.0 单词接龙 II（LeetCode-126）
题解一：官方经典（BFS + DFS 回溯）

思路：BFS 记录每词的层次与下一层邻居，DFS 在严格递增层次的邻接中构造所有最短路径。
复杂度：时间依赖解空间，BFS O(N × L × 26)；空间 O(N)。

import java.util.*;
class Solution {
    public List&lt;List&lt;String&gt;&gt; findLadders(String beginWord, String endWord, List&lt;String&gt; wordList) {
        Set&lt;String&gt; dict = new HashSet&lt;&gt;(wordList);
        List&lt;List&lt;String&gt;&gt; res = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();
        if (!dict.contains(endWord)) return res;
        dict.add(beginWord);
        Map&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt; next = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; dist = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        bfs(beginWord, endWord, dict, next, dist);
        if (!dist.containsKey(endWord)) return res;
        List&lt;String&gt; path = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(); path.add(beginWord);
        dfs(beginWord, endWord, next, dist, path, res);
        return res;
    }
    private void bfs(String begin, String end, Set&lt;String&gt; dict, Map&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt; next, Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; dist) {
        for (String w : dict) next.put(w, new ArrayList&lt;&gt;());
        Deque&lt;String&gt; q = new ArrayDeque&lt;&gt;(); q.offer(begin); dist.put(begin, 0);
        boolean found = false;
        while (!q.isEmpty() &amp;&amp; !found) {
            int sz = q.size();
            Set&lt;String&gt; layerVisited = new HashSet&lt;&gt;();
            for (int i = 0; i &lt; sz; i++) {
                String cur = q.poll(); int d = dist.get(cur);
                for (String nei : neighbors(cur, dict)) {
                    next.get(cur).add(nei);
                    if (!dist.containsKey(nei)) {
                        if (layerVisited.add(nei)) q.offer(nei);
                        dist.put(nei, d + 1);
                        if (nei.equals(end)) found = true;
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
    private void dfs(String cur, String end, Map&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt; next, Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; dist, List&lt;String&gt; path, List&lt;List&lt;String&gt;&gt; res) {
        if (cur.equals(end)) { res.add(new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(path)); return; }
        for (String nei : next.get(cur)) {
            if (dist.getOrDefault(nei, Integer.MAX_VALUE) == dist.get(cur) + 1) {
                path.add(nei); dfs(nei, end, next, dist, path, res); path.remove(path.size() - 1);
            }
        }
    }
    private List&lt;String&gt; neighbors(String s, Set&lt;String&gt; dict) {
        List&lt;String&gt; ans = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(); char[] arr = s.toCharArray();
        for (int i = 0; i &lt; arr.length; i++) {
            char old = arr[i];
            for (char c = &#039;a&#039;; c &lt;= &#039;z&#039;; c++) {
                if (c == old) continue; arr[i] = c; String t = new String(arr);
                if (dict.contains(t)) ans.add(t);
            }
            arr[i] = old;
        }
        return ans;
    }
}
题解二：通用解法（双向 BFS + 回溯）

标签：双向搜索、回溯
思路：从两端扩张，记录相遇层的邻接，再回溯构造路径；实现更复杂但搜索更少。

题解三：最好理解（“先找到最短层次，再沿层次回溯出所有路径”）

直觉：层次递增保证路径最短，DFS 只在最短层的邻接中行走。

总结思路

BFS+DFS 是标准范式，注意剪枝与层次边构造。

