方法三：DFS + 剪枝优化
class Solution {
    public List&lt;String&gt; removeInvalidParentheses(String s) {
        List&lt;String&gt; result = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();

        // 计算需要删除的左右括号数量
        int leftRemove = 0, rightRemove = 0;
        for (char c : s.toCharArray()) {
            if (c == &#039;(&#039;) {
                leftRemove++;
            } else if (c == &#039;)&#039;) {
                if (leftRemove &gt; 0) {
                    leftRemove--;
                } else {
                    rightRemove++;
                }
            }
        }

        dfs(s, 0, leftRemove, rightRemove, 0, new StringBuilder(), result);
        return result;
    }

    private void dfs(String s, int index, int leftRemove, int rightRemove, 
                     int open, StringBuilder path, List&lt;String&gt; result) {
        // 递归终止条件
        if (index == s.length()) {
            if (leftRemove == 0 &amp;&amp; rightRemove == 0 &amp;&amp; open == 0) {
                result.add(path.toString());
            }
            return;
        }

        char c = s.charAt(index);

        // 选择1：删除当前字符（如果是括号且还需要删除）
        if ((c == &#039;(&#039; &amp;&amp; leftRemove &gt; 0) || (c == &#039;)&#039; &amp;&amp; rightRemove &gt; 0)) {
            dfs(s, index + 1, 
                leftRemove - (c == &#039;(&#039; ? 1 : 0), 
                rightRemove - (c == &#039;)&#039; ? 1 : 0), 
                open, path, result);
        }

        // 选择2：保留当前字符
        path.append(c);
        if (c == &#039;(&#039;) {
            dfs(s, index + 1, leftRemove, rightRemove, open + 1, path, result);
        } else if (c == &#039;)&#039; &amp;&amp; open &gt; 0) {
            dfs(s, index + 1, leftRemove, rightRemove, open - 1, path, result);
        } else if (c != &#039;(&#039; &amp;&amp; c != &#039;)&#039;) {
            dfs(s, index + 1, leftRemove, rightRemove, open, path, result);
        }
        path.deleteCharAt(path.length() - 1);  // 回溯
    }
}
🔍 算法分析
时间复杂度

BFS方法：O(2^n)，最坏情况下需要尝试删除每个括号
DFS方法：O(2^n)，但剪枝效果更好
n为字符串长度

空间复杂度

BFS方法：O(2^n)，队列和visited集合的空间
DFS方法：O(n)，递归栈空间

