🧩 方法三：Trie树 + DFS（扩展思路）

说明：Trie 更适用于“单词搜索 II（多词）”，但也可用于本题作为统一搜索框架的练习与扩展。

class SolutionTrie {
    static class TrieNode {
        TrieNode[] children = new TrieNode[26];
        boolean end;
    }

    public boolean exist(char[][] board, String word) {
        int m = board.length, n = board[0].length;
        TrieNode root = buildTrie(word);

        for (int i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {
                if (dfs(board, i, j, root)) return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }

    private TrieNode buildTrie(String word) {
        TrieNode root = new TrieNode();
        TrieNode node = root;
        for (char c : word.toCharArray()) {
            int idx = Character.toLowerCase(c) - &#039;a&#039;;
            if (idx &lt; 0 || idx &gt;= 26) continue; // 非字母字符的健壮性处理
            if (node.children[idx] == null) node.children[idx] = new TrieNode();
            node = node.children[idx];
        }
        node.end = true;
        return root;
    }

    private boolean dfs(char[][] board, int r, int c, TrieNode node) {
        if (r &lt; 0 || r &gt;= board.length || c &lt; 0 || c &gt;= board[0].length) return false;
        char ch = board[r][c];
        if (ch == &#039;#&#039;) return false;

        int idx = Character.toLowerCase(ch) - &#039;a&#039;;
        if (idx &lt; 0 || idx &gt;= 26 || node.children[idx] == null) return false;

        node = node.children[idx];
        if (node.end) return true; // 匹配到完整单词

        board[r][c] = &#039;#&#039;;
        boolean found = dfs(board, r + 1, c, node) ||
                        dfs(board, r - 1, c, node) ||
                        dfs(board, r, c + 1, node) ||
                        dfs(board, r, c - 1, node);
        board[r][c] = ch;
        return found;
    }
}
复杂度与适用性

单词搜索 I（单词唯一）：时间复杂度与标准DFS同阶，常数开销略大；优势在于统一到“字典搜索”框架
单词搜索 II（多词搜索）：Trie 显著减少重复匹配，综合复杂度优于逐词DFS


单词搜索是DFS搜索的经典应用，掌握其搜索框架和回溯机制对解决类似的二维网格问题非常重要。

搜索和回溯/DFS搜索/题解2.0.0-岛屿数量.content:
题解2.0.0-岛屿数量：连通分量DFS搜索解法
🎯 解题思路
岛屿数量是典型的连通分量计数问题。核心思想是：

遍历网格，寻找未访问的陆地(‘1’)
每发现一个陆地，岛屿数量+1
使用DFS标记当前岛屿的所有连通陆地
继续遍历，寻找下一个岛屿

💻 完整代码实现
方法一：DFS + 原地标记（推荐）
class Solution {
    public int numIslands(char[][] grid) {
        if (grid == null || grid.length == 0) return 0;

        int m = grid.length;
        int n = grid[0].length;
        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {
                if (grid[i][j] == &#039;1&#039;) {
                    count++;           // 发现新岛屿
                    dfs(grid, i, j);   // 标记整个岛屿
                }
            }
        }

        return count;
    }

    private void dfs(char[][] grid, int i, int j) {
        int m = grid.length;
        int n = grid[0].length;

        // 边界检查：越界或已访问(水域)
        if (i &lt; 0 || i &gt;= m || j &lt; 0 || j &gt;= n || grid[i][j] == &#039;0&#039;) {
            return;
        }

        // 标记当前陆地为已访问
        grid[i][j] = &#039;0&#039;;

        // 四方向递归搜索
        dfs(grid, i + 1, j);  // 下
        dfs(grid, i - 1, j);  // 上
        dfs(grid, i, j + 1);  // 右
        dfs(grid, i, j - 1);  // 左
    }
}
方法二：DFS + visited数组
class Solution {
    private int[][] directions = {{0, 1}, {1, 0}, {0, -1}, {-1, 0}};

    public int numIslands(char[][] grid) {
        if (grid == null || grid.length == 0) return 0;

        int m = grid.length;
        int n = grid[0].length;
        boolean[][] visited = new boolean[m][n];
        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {
                if (grid[i][j] == &#039;1&#039; &amp;&amp; !visited[i][j]) {
                    count++;
                    dfs(grid, i, j, visited);
                }
            }
        }

        return count;
    }

    private void dfs(char[][] grid, int i, int j, boolean[][] visited) {
        int m = grid.length;
        int n = grid[0].length;

        if (i &lt; 0 || i &gt;= m || j &lt; 0 || j &gt;= n || 
            visited[i][j] || grid[i][j] == &#039;0&#039;) {
            return;
        }

        visited[i][j] = true;

        for (int[] dir : directions) {
            dfs(grid, i + dir[0], j + dir[1], visited);
        }
    }
}
方法三：BFS广度优先搜索
class Solution {
    public int numIslands(char[][] grid) {
        if (grid == null || grid.length == 0) return 0;

        int m = grid.length;
        int n = grid[0].length;
        int count = 0;
        int[][] directions = {{0, 1}, {1, 0}, {0, -1}, {-1, 0}};

        for (int i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {
                if (grid[i][j] == &#039;1&#039;) {
                    count++;

                    // BFS标记整个岛屿
                    Queue&lt;int[]&gt; queue = new LinkedList&lt;&gt;();
                    queue.offer(new int[]{i, j});
                    grid[i][j] = &#039;0&#039;;

                    while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
                        int[] curr = queue.poll();

                        for (int[] dir : directions) {
                            int newI = curr[0] + dir[0];
                            int newJ = curr[1] + dir[1];

                            if (newI &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; newI &lt; m &amp;&amp; newJ &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; newJ &lt; n &amp;&amp; 
                                grid[newI][newJ] == &#039;1&#039;) {
                                queue.offer(new int[]{newI, newJ});
                                grid[newI][newJ] = &#039;0&#039;;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        return count;
    }
}
🔍 算法分析
时间复杂度

O(M × N)：每个位置最多被访问一次
M为行数，N为列数

空间复杂度

方法一（原地标记）：O(M × N)，递归栈空间
方法二（visited数组）：O(M × N)，额外数组 + 递归栈
方法三（BFS）：O(min(M, N))，队列空间

